-// awaitParkedStreamNext proves the server loop is alive: the ping is
-// answered from inside a Next call, so the pong only arrives after the
-// server performed a stream read and looped back for the next one. It
-// cannot prove the next Next is already blocking, so the test also
-// requires ErrClosed from a follow-up Next: only cancellation of a
-// blocking read closes the connection.
